--------------------------------------------------
# 6. INTELLIGENT RENAMING
--------------------------------------------------

Identify files with poor names such as:

IMG_1234.jpg
document.pdf
final.pdf
new.pdf
scan0001.pdf
WhatsApp Document.pdf
download(4).pdf

Where safe and useful, rename them descriptively.

Preferred format:

YYYY-MM-DD_Category_Subject_Description

Example:

2026-09-20_Bank_SBI_Statement.pdf

2026-09-18_Legal_Property_Court_Order.pdf

2026-09-15_Invoice_Amazon_Order-12345.pdf

2026-09-10_Government_Aadhaar.pdf

DO NOT rename:

• System files
• Application-managed files
• Files whose names are required by an application
• Files where the correct identity cannot be established confidently

