MINIMUM CLUTTER + MAXIMUM ACCESSIBILITY.

--------------------------------------------------
# 8. DUPLICATE DETECTION
--------------------------------------------------

Find:

• Exact duplicate files
• Duplicate downloads
• Duplicate PDFs
• Duplicate images
• Duplicate videos
• Multiple copies of documents
• Repeated WhatsApp downloads
• Repeated screenshots

Use hashes/content comparison where possible.

Separate:

DEFINITE DUPLICATE
PROBABLE DUPLICATE
DIFFERENT VERSION OF SAME DOCUMENT

Never assume different versions are duplicates.

Do not permanently delete duplicates without explicit deletion authorization.

If appropriate, consolidate duplicates into:

Archive/Review_Duplicates/

--------------------------------------------------
