--------------------------------------------------
# 10. LARGE FILES
--------------------------------------------------

Find files consuming significant storage.

Initially flag:

• Files >100 MB
• Files >500 MB
• Files >1 GB

Classify them.

Examples:

Movies
Large videos
Backups
APK files
Archives
Duplicate files
Old downloads
Application data
Personal recordings

Do not delete simply because they are large.

--------------------------------------------------
